<title>CANADA: Buba's Hartmann - EMU delay not a good idea.</title>
<headline>Buba's Hartmann - EMU delay not a good idea.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank directorate member Wendelin Hartmann said on Friday that he was against any postponement of Europe's planned single currency.</p>
<p>&quot;I personally think that postponement is not a good idea,&quot; Hartmann told a conference at the Forex 97 meeting in Toronto.</p>
<p>Hartmann said that by postponement he meant a delay of one or two years, not a delay of one or two months because of parliamentary hold-ups.</p>
<p>He also said that if any delay to EMU were planned, the decision should be made early in order to prevent wasted efforts.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
